DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260507T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260507T193000
UID:69ce9ba34dacf581ff8613ec@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking to practice your English conversational skills
 ? Come for an informal discussion of various topics over a 8-week period a
 nd make new connections!\nNote: This is not a formal language class.\nDrop
  in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis\, Lower Level\, Room 2
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69ce9ba34dacf581ff8613ec
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tuesday Cozy Knits
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260505T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260505T200000
UID:69a9ff846583d22e3c0e145d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Whether you are into knitting\, crocheting\, embroidering or s
 ewing\, come join us for a relaxed and fun-knit time! Socialize\, share ti
 ps and work on your latest project in good company. Bring your yarn\, thr
 eads or fabric and let's craft together. All skill levels are welcome! Pl
 ease note that this is not a formal knitting/crochet class. Drop - in
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn\, Program room on the second floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69a9ff846583d22e3c0e145d
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
