DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260521T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260521T150000
UID:696a7e1fb0595799c096c3ef@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for your next great read?\nCome enjoy tea and light re
 freshments as we discuss the monthly list of fabulous books recommended b
 y Brentwood library staff members. A fun and engaging way to discover n
 ew authors and titles and to share what you've been reading with us!
LOCATION:Brentwood\, Community Room\, 1st Floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696a7e1fb0595799c096c3ef
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
